{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/en/web_table.html?id=660-78001A&api_popup=1"},"title":"Operating characteristics of enterprises analysed by sector (only including companies with employees), 2008 - 2017","tablenote":["For detailed statistics on the operating characteristics of enterprises after 2017, please refer to Table 660-78001.","Owing to limitations in sample size, sampling frame and sample design, detailed statistics for 2008 were crude estimates.","In this table, small and medium enterprises refer to those companies with fewer than 50 persons engaged.","Fast food cafes do not include takeaway shops.","Estate management, security and cleaning services do not include membership organisations.","Security services include investigation activities, pest control services and landscape care. Greenery services was included in security services starting from 2009.","In calculating figures for total receipts and profit of elderly homes, subsidies from government and other organisations were also included.","The 5th term of Minimum Wage Commission (2019-2021), in reviewing the coverage of the \"Low-paying sectors\" (LPS), decided to include the subsector \"food services\" which was under \"other sectors\" as part of \"Restaurants\" sector under LPS, and name it as \"Other food and beverage services\". The \"Restaurants\" sector was also renamed to \"Food and beverage services\", with the coverage of subsectors increasing to five (i.e. \"Chinese restaurants\", \"Non-Chinese restaurants\", \"Fast food cafes\", \"Hong Kong style tea cafes\", and \"Other food and beverage services\"). Hence, Statistics from 2018 or later may not be strictly comparable to those on or before 2017.","Non-low-paying sectors are sectors other than those in (A) above.","Figures were rounded to tens.","Earnings before tax ratio (abbreviated as profit ratio) refers to ratio of profit before deducting tax; gain/loss 